00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.146 line:0%
&gt;&gt; WE ARE AFRAID.

00:00:45.311 --> 00:00:47.247 line:0%
WE ARE PANICKING.

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:48.882 line:0%
MADONNA ARE SUPPOSED TO COME

