WE'VE NEVER KNOWN ANYTHING LIKE

00:00:53.420 --> 00:01:00.527 line:0%
THIS.

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:02.362 line:0%
&gt;&gt; CNN IT'LL CENTRAL, STREAMING

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:04.464 line:0%
US LIVE FROM LONDON.

00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:06.099 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU SO MUCH.

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:07.067 line:0%
THESE DRAMATIC SCENES,

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:08.201 line:0%
UNFOLDING IN GERMANY, THE

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:08.668 line:0%
