00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:17.277 line:0%
SYSTEM, LINGERING OVER THIS

00:01:15.642 --> 00:01:20.213 line:0%
PART OF EUROPE, FOR SOME TIME.

00:01:17.444 --> 00:01:20.647 line:0%
DUMPING, AS YOU, SAID HEAVY

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:23.116 line:0%
RAINFALL.

00:01:21.081 --> 00:01:24.084 line:0%
WE TOOK 2000 MILLIMETERS AND 9,

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:25.218 line:0%
HOURS HAVEN'T BEEN ABLE TO

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:27.420 line:0%
OBSERVE THAT BIG BURST, WITH

00:01:25.385 --> 00:01:29.422 line:0%
TRAGIC CONSEQUENCES.

