IS ONE OF THE 2 REGIONS WHERE

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:38.098 line:0%
THE DEATH TOLL IS THE HIGHEST.

00:01:36.029 --> 00:01:39.399 line:0%
2 REGIONS OF GERMANY, IN

00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:41.367 line:0%
PARTICULAR, AFFECTED, PROMPTING

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:43.369 line:0%
THE LOSS OF NEARLY 5000 LIVE SO

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:44.471 line:0%
FAR, BUT AS YOU POINTED, OUT

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:46.139 line:0%
SCHOOLS OF MISSING PEOPLE AT

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:47.407 line:0%
THIS POINT, AUTHORITIES JUST

