CAN'T REACH, BECAUSE MOBILE

00:01:47.574 --> 00:01:54.314 line:0%
PHONE NETWORKS ARE DOWN.

00:01:51.044 --> 00:01:55.348 line:0%
I DID THE REALTIME, THESE ARE

00:01:54.481 --> 00:01:57.350 line:0%
THE SCENES AGREE TO GERMANY,

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:58.518 line:0%
AND THOSE OTHER COUNTRIES.

