00:02:15.869 --> 00:02:19.105 line:0%
RIVERS, OVERFLOWING THEIR BANKS,

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:21.241 line:0%
HOUSES COLLAPSED, ROADS WERE

00:02:19.272 --> 00:02:21.708 line:0%
