OTHERS, LEFT WITH NOTHING.

00:02:34.988 --> 00:02:38.258 line:0%
&gt;&gt; ARE THESE PEOPLE LIVING HERE,

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:39.425 line:0%
I KNOW THEM WELL.

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.426 line:0%
I FEEL SO SORRY FOR THEM.

00:02:39.592 --> 00:02:43.163 line:0%
THEY HAVE LOST EVERYTHING.

00:02:41.027 --> 00:02:43.563 line:0%
ALL THEY HAVE AS WHAT THEY HAD

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:45.198 line:0%
AUTUMN.

