IT'S GONE, AFFIRMED HAD A

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:47.534 line:0%
WORKSHOP OVER THERE, NOTHING

00:02:47.267 --> 00:02:49.402 line:0%
STANDING.

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:50.270 line:0%
THE BAKERY, THE BUTCHER, IT IS

00:02:49.836 --> 00:02:51.638 line:0%
ALL GONE.

00:02:50.436 --> 00:02:56.910 line:0%
IT'S SCARY, UNIMAGINABLE.

00:02:55.308 --> 00:02:58.745 line:0%
THIS DRAMATIC SCENE, AND

