00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:06.519 line:0%
ACROSS THE BORDER, IN BELGIUM,

00:03:03.917 --> 00:03:07.787 line:0%
THIS MAN BRAVED THE WATER TO

00:03:06.686 --> 00:03:10.723 line:0%
CHECK ON HIS NEIGHBORS.

00:03:08.288 --> 00:03:12.859 line:0%
ALMOST REACHING THEIR WINDOWS.

00:03:11.291 --> 00:03:15.862 line:0%
