&gt;&gt; MY MOTHER, STUCK IN A HOUSE

00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:25.772 line:0%
OVER THERE, WITH MY BROTHERS,

00:03:24.938 --> 00:03:26.806 line:0%
AND MY SISTERS.

00:03:25.939 --> 00:03:27.707 line:0%
THE WALLS OF THE HOUSE,

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:31.744 line:0%
STARTING TO CRACK.

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:34.714 line:0%
THE HOUSE, AT RISK OF COLLAPSE.

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:37.750 line:0%
&gt;&gt; IN THE NETHERLANDS, A CARE

00:03:34.881 --> 00:03:38.117 line:0%
HOME WAS EVACUATED DURING THE

00:03:37.917 --> 00:03:39.719 line:0%
STORM.

