THEY HOPE TO GET OVERLY

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:43.656 line:0%
RESIDENTS TO SAFETY, DURING THE

00:03:41.688 --> 00:03:44.791 line:0%
FACILITY WITH ELECTRICITY WITH

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:47.026 line:0%
OTHER SUPPLIES.

