MERKEL, SAID THAT SHE IS

00:03:49.696 --> 00:03:52.966 line:0%
THINKING OF THOSE IN HER

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:55.735 line:0%
HOMELAND.

00:03:54.467 --> 00:03:57.570 line:0%
&gt;&gt; THESE ARE TERRIBLE DAYS FOR

00:03:56.269 --> 00:03:57.937 line:0%
THE PEOPLE IN THE FLOODED

00:03:57.737 --> 00:03:59.639 line:0%
AREAS.

