REGIONAL, AND COMMUNITY,

00:04:04.677 --> 00:04:08.314 line:0%
COLLECTIVELY, WILL DO

00:04:07.714 --> 00:04:09.549 line:0%
EVERYTHING UNDER MOST OF LOCAL

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:12.819 line:0%
CONDITIONS TO SAVE LIVES,

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:13.253 line:0%
ALLEVIATE DANGERS, AND RELIEVED

00:04:12.986 --> 00:04:15.822 line:0%
