&gt;&gt; SURE TO GERMANY'S MILITARY

00:04:15.989 --> 00:04:17.690 line:0%
TO HELP AND SOME OF THE HARDEST

00:04:17.257 --> 00:04:19.726 line:0%
HIT AREAS.

