A GERMAN METEOROLOGIST SAYING,

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:22.662 line:0%
IN SOME AREAS, THEY HAVEN'T

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:23.029 line:0%
SEEN THIS MUCH RAINFALL IN 100

00:04:22.829 --> 00:04:25.732 line:0%
YEARS.

