00:05:05.705 --> 00:05:10.677 line:0%
RESCUE EFFORT IS UNDERWAY.

00:05:07.307 --> 00:05:13.746 line:0%
THIS WILL ALSO, AS YOU POINT

00:05:10.843 --> 00:05:15.581 line:0%
OUT, SEE THE CLIMATE CHANGE IN

00:05:13.913 --> 00:05:18.751 line:0%
GERMANY, AS WE HEAD TOWARDS THE

00:05:15.748 --> 00:05:19.185 line:0%
ELECTIONS IN THE 26TH OF

00:05:18.918 --> 00:05:20.887 line:0%
SEPTEMBER.

