NINA SAID, A MOMENT AGO, IT'S

00:05:46.012 --> 00:05:48.981 line:0%
THESE HIGH ENERGY, SUDDEN

00:05:47.313 --> 00:05:50.983 line:0%
TORRENTS OF SUMMER RAIN, THAT

00:05:49.749 --> 00:05:53.886 line:0%
IS WHAT WE WOULD EXPECT TO SEE

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:54.620 line:0%
IN A WARMING CLIMATE, RAPIDLY

00:05:54.053 --> 00:05:54.954 line:0%
WARMING, LIKE WE EXPERIENCE

00:05:54.787 --> 00:05:56.856 line:0%
NOW.

00:05:55.588 --> 00:05:58.825 line:0%
WARMER AIR HOLDS MORE WATER

00:05:57.023 --> 00:06:00.126 line:0%
VAPOR, WATER VAPOR HAS A CHANCE

00:05:58.991 --> 00:06:01.060 line:0%
TO UNLEASH MORE RAINFALL, AND

00:06:00.293 --> 00:06:03.896 line:0%
WHEN THAT INTERSECTS WITH THE

00:06:01.227 --> 00:06:05.998 line:0%
POPULAR AREA, THAT IS

00:06:04.063 --> 00:06:10.837 line:0%
UNFORTUNATELY WHAT TOOK PLACE.

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:13.005 line:0%
I AND IT IS THE ATMOSPHERE IN

00:06:11.003 --> 00:06:14.841 line:0%
EUROPE, AND WHAT THEY DID IS

00:06:13.172 --> 00:06:15.341 line:0%
THEY STARTED TO MAP OFF THE

00:06:15.007 --> 00:06:17.043 line:0%
FLOODED AREAS.

