00:06:26.753 --> 00:06:28.354 line:0%
IT IS OVER FLOODING IT'S RIVER

00:06:28.154 --> 00:06:30.056 line:0%
BANKS.

00:06:28.554 --> 00:06:31.057 line:0%
YOU CAN SEE THE EXTENSIVE

00:06:30.223 --> 00:06:34.093 line:0%
NATURE OF THE FLOODING.

00:06:32.592 --> 00:06:36.028 line:0%
INJUSTICE TOWN IN BELGIUM, IT

00:06:34.894 --> 00:06:37.797 line:0%
IS THE LOCATION HIT HARDEST.

00:06:36.195 --> 00:06:39.832 line:0%
WE WENT BACK 48 HOURS, ON THE

