BELGIUM, WESTERN GERMANY,

00:06:48.007 --> 00:06:50.877 line:0%
LUXEMBOURG, THOSE ARE THE AREAS

00:06:48.975 --> 00:06:52.111 line:0%
HIT HARDEST BY THIS TORRENT OF

00:06:51.043 --> 00:06:53.846 line:0%
PRECIPITATION, ALL THANKS TO

00:06:52.278 --> 00:06:54.380 line:0%
WHAT'S CALLED, A CUT OFF, LOW

00:06:54.013 --> 00:06:56.215 line:0%
PRESSURE SYSTEM.

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:58.017 line:0%
THIS IS WATER VAPOR ENERGY, AND

00:06:56.549 --> 00:06:59.085 line:0%
YOU CAN SEE HOW THE LOW SPINS,

00:06:58.184 --> 00:07:01.087 line:0%
