00:06:59.752 --> 00:07:02.121 line:0%
IT IS CUT OFF FROM THE GENERAL

00:07:01.254 --> 00:07:03.856 line:0%
FLOW OF THE ATMOSPHERE.

00:07:02.288 --> 00:07:05.892 line:0%
IT IS NOWHERE TO GO, IT SITS IN

00:07:04.023 --> 00:07:07.160 line:0%
THE SAME LOCATION, THAT IS WHAT

00:07:06.058 --> 00:07:10.096 line:0%
PRODUCES THIS EXCESSIVE AMOUNT

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:12.298 line:0%
