THAT'S NOT JUST BECAUSE OF

00:07:54.006 --> 00:07:55.441 line:0%
RISING SEA LEVELS FROM CLIMATE

00:07:55.208 --> 00:07:56.843 line:0%
CHANGE.

00:07:55.775 --> 00:07:59.045 line:0%
IN THE MIDDLE OF THE NEXT

00:07:57.009 --> 00:08:00.847 line:0%
DECADE, THE LUNAR CYCLE WILL

00:07:59.212 --> 00:08:01.380 line:0%
FLIP INTO A PHASE THAT

00:08:01.013 --> 00:08:03.149 line:0%
AMPLIFIES TIDES.

00:08:01.781 --> 00:08:05.117 line:0%
IT IS CALLED THE MOON WOBBLE.

00:08:03.583 --> 00:08:07.119 line:0%
THAT MEANS THAT HIGH TIDES WILL

00:08:05.551 --> 00:08:07.954 line:0%
GET HIGH, AND LOW TIDES WILL

00:08:07.553 --> 00:08:09.922 line:0%
GET LOW.

00:08:08.120 --> 00:08:11.023 line:0%
THEY'RE EXPECTING TO SEE A

00:08:10.089 --> 00:08:12.124 line:0%
CLIMATE DRIVEN RISING SEA

00:08:11.190 --> 00:08:13.292 line:0%
LEVELS BY THEN, SEEING THAT

00:08:12.291 --> 00:08:15.027 line:0%
SOME COASTAL CITIES WILL SEE

00:08:13.459 --> 00:08:16.028 line:0%
FLOOD SEASONS LASTING A MONTH,

00:08:15.761 --> 00:08:17.864 line:0%
OR LONGER.

00:08:16.195 --> 00:08:19.098 line:0%
DURING THIS TIME, AFFECTED

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:20.066 line:0%
AREAS COULD FLOOD EVERY COUPLE

00:08:19.832 --> 00:08:22.168 line:0%
OF DAYS.

