THE ATMOSPHERIC SCIENTISTS,

00:08:22.335 --> 00:08:24.070 line:0%
TALKED ABOUT THE LUNAR CYCLE,

00:08:23.202 --> 00:08:27.006 line:0%
AND HOW MUCH WORSE THAT THIS

00:08:24.237 --> 00:08:27.440 line:0%
COULD ALL MAKE COASTAL

00:08:27.173 --> 00:08:29.008 line:0%
FLOODING.

00:08:27.740 --> 00:08:31.811 line:0%
&gt;&gt; SEA LEVEL WILL BE A BIT

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:32.278 line:0%
HIGHER, AND IT DEFINITELY IS

00:08:31.978 --> 00:08:33.145 line:0%
INCREASING.

00:08:32.445 --> 00:08:34.981 line:0%
IT'S ACCELERATING.

00:08:33.546 --> 00:08:37.016 line:0%
THE INCREASE IS SPEEDING UP.

00:08:35.581 --> 00:08:38.818 line:0%
THAT WILL CONTINUE, AS LONG AS

00:08:37.183 --> 00:08:39.919 line:0%
WE CONTINUE TO WARM UP THE

00:08:38.985 --> 00:08:43.022 line:0%
PLANET.

