IT IS THE PEAK OF A HIGH TIDE.

00:08:53.766 --> 00:08:57.837 line:0%
SO, IT WAS ONCE A PERFECT STORM,

00:08:56.569 --> 00:08:58.804 line:0%
AND IF YOU PARDON THE

00:08:58.004 --> 00:09:01.073 line:0%
