00:08:58.971 --> 00:09:03.009 line:0%
LEVEL RISE, A BIGGER, STRONGER

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:05.811 line:0%
STORM, THEN WE HAVE SEEN, THAT

00:09:03.576 --> 00:09:06.212 line:0%
FAR NORTH, THAT LATE IN THE

00:09:05.978 --> 00:09:08.981 line:0%
SEASON.

00:09:06.779 --> 00:09:11.951 line:0%
AND, IT HAPPENED AT HIGH TIDE.

00:09:09.749 --> 00:09:14.186 line:0%
ALL OF THESE CAME TOGETHER TO

00:09:12.118 --> 00:09:16.088 line:0%
GIVE US THE 14 FOOT STORM SURGE,

00:09:14.353 --> 00:09:18.791 line:0%
BATTERY PARK THAT, LITERALLY,

00:09:16.255 --> 00:09:19.859 line:0%
FLOODED LARGE PARTS OF UPPER

00:09:18.958 --> 00:09:22.828 line:0%
MANHATTAN.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:24.063 line:0%
SO, THIS IS SORT OF THE SAME

00:09:22.995 --> 00:09:25.064 line:0%
IDEA, BUT IT'S PLAYING OUT ON A

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:26.832 line:0%
LONGER TIME.

00:09:25.231 --> 00:09:28.935 line:0%
YOU HAVE SEA LEVEL RISE, YOU

00:09:26.999 --> 00:09:31.070 line:0%
HAVE STRONGER STORMS, AND

00:09:29.101 --> 00:09:32.838 line:0%
BIGGER STORM SURGES, AND THEN

00:09:31.237 --> 00:09:35.808 line:0%
JUST BECAUSE OF THE NATURAL

00:09:33.005 --> 00:09:38.978 line:0%
CYCLE, NOT THE SHORT TERM HIGH

00:09:35.975 --> 00:09:41.013 line:0%
TIDE, AND THE OTHER HIGH TIDE,

00:09:39.145 --> 00:09:42.048 line:0%
IT WILL ADD TO ALL OF THOSE

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:44.016 line:0%
STORM SURGES.

00:09:42.214 --> 00:09:45.051 line:0%
ALONG WITH SEA LEVEL RISE.

00:09:44.183 --> 00:09:47.853 line:0%
THAT IS WHAT HAPPENS.

00:09:45.751 --> 00:09:50.156 line:0%
IT GETS A LITTLE HIGHER, EACH

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:52.992 line:0%
