LEVEL, IN NEW YORK CITY, THUS

00:10:00.032 --> 00:10:05.071 line:0%
FAR, BECAUSE OF GLOBAL WARMING.

00:10:01.801 --> 00:10:07.940 line:0%
A LITTLE LESS THAN 12 INCHES.

00:10:05.638 --> 00:10:08.841 line:0%
THERE IS 25 ADDITIONAL SQUARE

00:10:08.107 --> 00:10:09.308 line:0%
MILES OF LETTING THE SUPER

00:10:09.008 --> 00:10:11.010 line:0%
STORM SANDY.

